# congress.gov.ph scraper: live session cookies and browser state.
# cf_cookies.json holds an authenticated hrep_20th_congress_session token plus
# cf_clearance/XSRF-TOKEN; state/ is a scratch Chrome profile carrying the
# decrypted Cookies DB. Neither may be committed.
DEO2LEG/legislative_profiles/cf_cookies.json
DEO2LEG/legislative_profiles/session.json
DEO2LEG/legislative_profiles/browser.json
DEO2LEG/legislative_profiles/state/
# Raw "Save Page As" browser capture and CDP scrape HTML. Intermediate, large,
# and regenerated by scrape.py / build_dataset.py.
DEO2LEG/legislative_profiles/CONGRESS_WEB/
DEO2LEG/legislative_profiles/*.html

