# Congress DEO lens: the index is rebuilt by analysis/web/buildCongressIndex.mjs
# from the (larger) comparison payload. The WebP portraits are pre-rendered and
# COMMITTED — they change only when the roster changes, and
# scripts/build_congress_portraits.py --check (hash-only, no Pillow) verifies
# staleness in CI. Run the builder without arguments to re-render after a
# roster or display-size change, then commit the result.
analysis/data/congress_district_index_2027.json
